    "pp_faq_TtURdM": {
      "type": "pp-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "question_UUEbPG": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is it really waterproof?",
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "heading_color": "#000000",
            "text": "<p>Yes. Once the formula sets it resists water, sweat and humidity, so it holds through workouts, hot weather and teary moments without running.</p>",
            "text_style": "body",
            "text_color": "#000000"
          }
        },
        "question_iwgzRn": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I use it on my brows as well as my eyes?",
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "heading_color": "#000000",
            "text": "<p>That is what the fine tip is designed for. Use long strokes along the lash line for liner, and short feathered strokes through the brow to fill sparse areas and shape the arch.</p>",
            "text_style": "body",
            "text_color": "#000000"
          }
        },
        "question_gNmdPq": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Which shade should I choose?",
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "heading_color": "#000000",
            "text": "<p>Black and Graphite give the most definition. Brown, Chocolate and Bronze suit lighter hair and a softer daytime look. Plum flatters green and hazel eyes, and Stone works as a subtle everyday brow shade.</p>",
            "text_style": "body",
            "text_color": "#000000"
          }
        },
        "question_NpRfRa": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will it smudge or transfer onto my lids?",
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "heading_color": "#000000",
            "text": "<p>The matte formula sets within seconds of application and stays put. Allow a moment to dry before blinking hard or applying other products over the top.</p>",
            "text_style": "body",
            "text_color": "#000000"
          }
        },
        "question_cwFiY9": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I remove it?",
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "heading_color": "#000000",
            "text": "<p>Because it is waterproof, water alone will not lift it. Use an oil-based or bi-phase makeup remover on a cotton pad, hold it against the lash line for a few seconds, then wipe gently.</p>",
            "text_style": "body",
            "text_color": "#000000"
          }
        }
